                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Senate Republicans are voting to cut Medicaid, food stamps, and other life saving services just to give a $3.8 BILLION tax cut to the richest people in the world.\n\nFamilies will go hungry, hospitals will close, and people will die all so that billionaires don\u2019t have to pay their fair share.",
