                "text": "Senate Republicans just chose billionaires over working families.\n\n17 million Americans will lose their healthcare \u2014 the largest Medicaid cut ever. Kids, seniors, and veterans will go hungry.\n\nAll to give tax breaks to the top 1%.\n\nHouse Republicans need to grow a spine and reject this abomination.",
