                "text": "A few months ago, I met with Mercedes and her 5-year-old son Dino. Dino is battling brain cancer. If Republicans' Big Ugly Bill passes, Mercedes will be unable to pay for Dino\u2019s cancer treatment.\n\nWith this bill, Congressional Republicans will take healthcare away from millions of families in need.",
