                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "From the biggest Medicaid cut in history to trillions in tax breaks for billionaires, you\u2019ve all heard me talk about the awful pieces of the Big Ugly Bill.\n\nBut here\u2019s one you might\u2019ve missed: it also immediately guts funding for Planned Parenthood. Watch me explain what this means for OC families\ud83d\udc47",
