                "text": "Medicaid saves lives. \n\nOn the 60th anniversary of Medicaid, I wanted to highlight some of the people who\u2019ve shared their stories of how Medi-Cal changed their lives. \n\nI\u2019ll keep fighting to defend Medi-Cal and ensure every American has access to high quality, affordable health care.",
